Screen Open 0,500,500,8,Hires

Global MY_GLOBAL_VAR
MY_GLOBAL_VAR = 10
NORMAL_VAR = 15
    
Procedure P_MYPROC  
  MY_GLOBAL_VAR = 20
  LOCAL_VAR = 10
End Proc


P_MYPROC
Text 10,10,Str$(MY_GLOBAL_VAR)
Text 10,30,Str$(NORMAL_VAR)
Text 10,50,Str$(LOCAL_VAR)

--

This program prints 20, 15, *0* in real AMOS
It prints 20, 15, *nothing* in CRVJA

Console shows:
```
Async error in dynamic JavaScript:
ReferenceError: Can't find variable: LOCAL_VAR
```